<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 26.80 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate rises to 26.80 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate rose by 72.5 basis points to 26.80 percent on Friday, from 26.0750 percent on Thursday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is replacing the TIIP, an average interbank rate.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom, +525 7289558</p>
